  <model metaid="meta_tirzepatide_intestine" id="tirzepatide_intestine" name="Model for the fecal excretion of the tirzepatide metabolites" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model for the fecal excretion of the tirzepatide metabolites</h1>
        <p>The metabolites which the liver excretes into the intestinal lumen pass
a transit chain of <code>n_chain</code> compartments into the feces, with the same
rate <code>TMEXC_k</code> per step; the mean transit time is (1 + n_chain)/TMEXC_k.</p>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
