    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="Vchain" name="volume of chain compartment" value="0.1" units="litre" constant="true"/>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="TMEXC_k" name="rate of the intestinal transit of the tirzepatide metabolites" value="0.002" units="per_min" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The rate per step of the transit chain from the intestinal
lumen into the feces; the mean transit time is
(1 + n_chain)/TMEXC_k = 50 hr, the whole gut transit time of
about 2 days. Not fitted: the cumulative recovery in the feces
(Martin2024) does not identify it (profile likelihood flat
over a mean transit of 12 hr to 5 days).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
